  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Security release — hardening against malicious .msg files:\n• Fixed arbitrary file read / NTLM credential leak: external (ATTACH_BY_REFERENCE) attachments are no longer read automatically. Use the new Attachment.ResolveExternalReference() opt-in API (see IsExternalReference / ExternalReferencePath).\n• Fixed uncatchable StackOverflow from deeply nested embedded messages (now capped at depth 10, throws MRMaxEmbeddedDepthReached).\n• Fixed OutOfMemory from untrusted RTF uncompressed-size (capped at 100 MB) and unbounded stream reads (capped at 256 MB).\n• Fixed crash (IndexOutOfRange) on truncated property records.\n⚠ Breaking: ATTACH_BY_REFERENCE attachments are no longer resolved automatically — call ResolveExternalReference() if you need their bytes.",
